sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant A as app.py
    participant T as train.py
    participant D as data folder
    participant M as models folder
    U->>A: Press Train model now
    A->>T: main(progress)
    T->>D: find and read dataset CSV
    T->>T: load 10,000 balanced reviews and clean
    T->>T: split 80 20 and fit TF-IDF on train
    T->>T: train LR, SVM, Random Forest, XGBoost
    T->>T: compare accuracy, precision, recall, F1
    T->>M: save vectorizer, best model, explainer, results, meta
    T-->>A: results table
    A->>A: clear cache and rerun
    A-->>U: Model ready
